n><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Photos &amp; Video</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"bd-menu__link\" href=\"/sign-in\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Sign in</span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></dialog></div></nav><p class=\"bd-masthead__motto\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"bd-masthead__rule\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><span class=\"bd-script\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Love, peace &amp; happiness</span></span></p></div></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"bd-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-bl-k=\"main\" data-bl-label=\"White City Ballroom\"><header class=\"bd-pagehead\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"header\" data-bl-label=\"White City Ballroom\"><img class=\"bd-bloom bd-bloom--pagehead\" src=\"/media/botanical-deco/botanical/corner-tl-138.webp\" width=\"138\" height=\"278\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-media=\"botanical.corner-tl\" data-bl-m=\"art\"><span class=\"bd-pagehead__skyline\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><div class=\"bd-pagehead__inner\"><p class=\"bd-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span></p><h1 class=\"bd-h bd-h--1 bd-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">White City Ballroom</span></h1><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-lede bd-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Floor-to-ceiling windows, vintage stained glass, an original Carrara marble floor, three 19th-century fireplaces, and 167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"look\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"look-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Look for this\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"look-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Look for this</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><ol class=\"bd-docent\" aria-label=\"Look for this\"><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">01</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Count the illuminated ceiling embellishments: the kit says 167 were restored.</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The floor is original Carrara marble.</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Three fireplaces date from the 19th century.</span></span></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What is in the room\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"features-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What is in the room</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-prose\"><ul class=\"bd-list\"><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">floor-to-ceiling windows</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">vintage stained glass</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">original Carrara marble floor</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">three 19th-century fireplaces</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"capacity\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"capacity-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity (from the venue kit)\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"capacity-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Capacity (from the venue kit)</